{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# HitImpact｜静态结构\n所属AbilitySystem／Cues。箭头标签表示数据、持有、继承或接口调用关系。\n[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|接口与职责]] · [[GGYGO_流程_HitImpact.canvas|执行流程]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|父模块]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1730,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 载荷提供者与输入\nCombat提供窗口内去重HitResult；GA的BuildHitEffectPayload提供Context／可选Spec／Cue载荷。\n输入为原Target、World和FGameplayCueParameters：HitResult、Location／Normal、AggregatedTargetTags。\nPhysics提供材质Tags，普通材质无项目Tags。\n[[Combat/结构|碰撞职责]] · [[Physics/结构|材质职责]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GA／GAS接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-cue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayCueNotify_HitImpact\nHandleGameplayCue(Target,Event,Params)：Cue事件入口，消费原载荷。\nOnExecute_Implementation(Target,Params)：同步表现执行入口。\nResolveImpactPresentation(Target,Params) const：返回只读解析结果，不播放或写Context。\n持有资产配置与每原因一次诊断标记，不持命中／伤害权威或第二Cue调度器。\n[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构#关键接口契约|输入、产物与责任]]",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cue BP 配置 / FGGYGOHitImpactEffect\nLocationMode 默认 HitResult；可显式选 ParametersLocation / TargetCenter。\nNoSurfacePolicy 默认 Generic；可选 Reject。\nbAllowUnmatchedSurfaceGeneric 默认 false。\nSurfaceEffects 按顺序层级匹配；DefaultEffect 仅按明确政策使用。\nEffect：SurfaceTag、可选 ImpactEffect / ImpactSound。\n继承 Burst 配置须兼容选定落点。",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-result",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOHitImpactResolveResult\n按值输出：Failure、Location、Normal、Detail、const Effect 借用指针。\nIsSuccess → Failure=None 且 Effect 非空。\nEffect 只借用当前 Cue 配置；外调前复制所需资源并结束借用。\n不保存命中权威状态，不签发另一生命周期资源。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-burst",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 引擎 UGameplayCueNotify_Burst\n提供 DefaultSpawnCondition / DefaultPlacementInfo / BurstEffects。\nOnExecute → 原生 Burst 与 OnBurst；即使播放也固定返回 false。\n本类只读预检已配置空间输出；落点冲突明确拒绝，反射类型变化明确失败。\n不提前运行 ShouldSpawn，不修改引擎或伪造 BlockingHit。",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-playback",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 调用期资源与播放接口\n位置／旋转／参数按值；所选粒子／声音为调用期强引用，原Target／World为弱身份。\n自身反馈接口：Niagara::SpawnSystemAtLocation、GameplayStatics::PlaySoundAtLocation。\n调用期资源不存入成员；退出释放强引用，依赖失效不换资源继续。\n[[Audio/结构|声音资源职责]]",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hitimpact-structure-status",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 反馈职责与接口边界\n伤害归GA／GE／Execution／AttributeSet；本类只消费载荷并提供表现。\n父类Burst持有原生反馈与条件，自身SurfaceEffects持有表面粒子／声音配置。\n位置模式由资产显式选择，父类落点冲突明确拒绝。\n同步返回true不表示粒子可见、声音可听或网络到达。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 1730,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
